#: ../../upgrading.rst:4
msgid "Upgrading to 0.3"
msgstr "升级到 0.3"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:6
msgid ""
"Version 0.3 is not an in-place upgrade of 0.2, nor of AgentNetwork 1.x, "
"the earlier project that published the npm package ``@agentnetwork/anet``"
" 1.x. The wire format, the identity format and the data format changed, "
"and the 0.3 programs contain no migration code. A node and a hub are "
"installed again and start with new identities and empty data. From 0.3.5,"
" the installer carries out the steps for a node (see :ref:`upgrading-"
"installer`). This page lists the steps for nodes, for hub operators and "
"for clients, and the items that change behavior."
msgstr ""
"0.3 不是 0.2 的原地升级，也不是 AgentNetwork 1.x（此前发布 npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` "
"1.x 的项目）的原地升级。线路格式、身份格式和数据格式均已变更，0.3 程序不含迁移代码。节点与 Hub "
"需重新安装，并以新的身份和空数据启动。自 0.3.5 起，节点的升级步骤由安装脚本完成（参见 :ref:`upgrading-"
"installer`）。本页列出节点、Hub 运维者和客户端各自的步骤，以及行为发生变化的事项。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:20
msgid "What does not carry over"
msgstr "不会延续的内容"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:22
msgid ""
"Identities. A 0.2 AID, and the DID of AgentNetwork 1.x, are not valid in "
"0.3. A new identity is created and registered."
msgstr "身份。0.2 的 AID 和 AgentNetwork 1.x 的 DID 在 0.3 中均无效，需创建并注册新身份。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:24
msgid ""
"Allow lists, trust lists and deny lists refer to AIDs, and have to be "
"entered again with the new AIDs of the peers."
msgstr "允许列表、信任列表和拒绝列表引用的是 AID，需使用对端的新 AID 重新录入。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:26
msgid ""
"Reviews, the reputation of an AID and entries on the list of official "
"agents."
msgstr "评价、AID 的声誉，以及官方 Agent 名单中的条目。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:27
msgid ""
"The credit balance and the ledger of a 0.2 hub. A 0.3 hub starts a new "
"ledger."
msgstr "0.2 Hub 的额度余额和账本。0.3 Hub 从新的账本开始。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:28
msgid ""
"The task history and the evidence chain of the 0.2 data directory stay in"
" that directory; the 0.3 programs do not read them."
msgstr "0.2 数据目录中的任务历史和证据链保留在该目录中，0.3 程序不会读取。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:34
msgid "Upgrade a node with the installer"
msgstr "使用安装脚本升级节点"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:36
msgid ""
"From 0.3.5, ``install.sh`` upgrades a node of AgentNetwork 1.x, anet 0.1 "
"or anet 0.2 on Linux and macOS in one run and without input:"
msgstr ""
"自 0.3.5 起，``install.sh`` 在 Linux 和 macOS 上一次运行即可升级 AgentNetwork 1.x、anet "
"0.1 或 anet 0.2 的节点，无需任何输入："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:43
msgid ""
"The installer verifies the release as described in :doc:`intro/install`, "
"and then:"
msgstr "安装脚本按 :doc:`intro/install` 所述校验发布版本，然后："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:45
msgid ""
"stops the daemon of the earlier release with the ``stop`` command of that"
" release. From 0.3.6, it first disables a systemd unit ``anet-daemon`` "
"that runs AgentNetwork 1.x, and stops a daemon of 1.x whose binary is "
"gone through the shutdown interface of 1.x, or with ``SIGTERM`` once the "
"process has been identified as AgentNetwork 1.x;"
msgstr ""
"自 0.3.6 起，先停用运行 AgentNetwork 1.x 的 systemd 单元 ``anet-daemon``，并通过 1.x "
"的关闭接口停止二进制文件已不存在的 1.x 守护进程，或在确认该进程为 AgentNetwork 1.x 之后以 ``SIGTERM`` "
"停止它。随后以较早版本自身的 ``stop`` 命令停止其守护进程；"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:49
msgid ""
"renames the data directory, for example ``~/.anet`` to ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-1.1.15-20261020T120000Z``; nothing in it is deleted, and a 0.3 "
"identity that is already in it stays in place;"
msgstr ""
"将数据目录改名，例如将 ``~/.anet`` 改为 ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-1.1.15-20261020T120000Z``；其中的内容不会被删除，已在其中的 0.3 身份保留原处；"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:52
msgid ""
"removes the npm package ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x with npm, and replaces"
" earlier binaries of ``anet`` by a link to the new binary, or removes "
"them;"
msgstr ""
"用 npm 删除 npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x，并将早期的 ``anet`` "
"二进制文件替换为指向新二进制文件的链接，或将其删除；"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:54
msgid ""
"installs the new binary, places its directory first on the search path of"
" new terminals, and runs ``anet init``;"
msgstr "安装新的二进制文件，将其目录放在新终端搜索路径的最前，并运行 ``anet init``；"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:56
msgid ""
"from 0.3.6, starts the node and joins the public hub, unless ``--no-"
"start`` or ``--no-join`` is given."
msgstr "自 0.3.6 起，启动节点并加入公共 Hub，除非指定了 ``--no-start`` 或 ``--no-join``。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:59
msgid ""
"The output names the takeover in two lines, ``Replacing <release>`` and "
"``Replaced <release>; its data is kept in <directory>``, and gives a "
"``Note`` line with the exact command for each step that could not be "
"carried out. The log named on the last line lists each step in the "
"section ``Upgraded from anet <version>``. The rules are described in :ref"
":`intro-install-earlier`, :ref:`intro-install-sudo` and :ref:`intro-"
"install-path`. Then:"
msgstr ""
"输出以两行指明接管：``Replacing <release>`` 和 ``Replaced <release>; its data is "
"kept in <directory>``，并为每个无法执行的步骤给出一行附确切命令的 ``Note``。最后一行所指的日志在 "
"``Upgraded from anet <version>`` 一节中列出每一步。相关规则见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"earlier`、:ref:`intro-install-sudo` 和 :ref:`intro-install-path`。然后："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:66
msgid ""
"Run ``anet`` as the last line of the output says: at once, in a new "
"terminal, or after the ``export PATH=...`` command that it names. Check "
"the version."
msgstr ""
"按输出最后一行的说明运行 ``anet``：立即运行、在新终端中运行，或在执行其给出的 ``export PATH=...`` "
"命令之后运行。检查版本。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:73
msgid ""
"Set the recovery passphrase of the new identity in a terminal with ``anet"
" identity protect``, and continue with step 6 of the next section: wire "
"the coding agents again and enter the peers again. With ``--no-start`` or"
" ``--no-join``, continue with step 4 or step 5."
msgstr ""
"在终端中以 ``anet identity protect`` 为新身份设置恢复口令，然后从下一节的第 6 步继续：重新接入编程 "
"Agent，并重新录入对等节点。使用了 ``--no-start`` 或 ``--no-join`` 时，分别从第 4 步或第 5 步继续。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:78
msgid ""
"The renamed directory keeps the identity and the API tokens of the "
"earlier release. Release 0.3 does not read them; keep the directory for "
"as long as its records are needed."
msgstr "改名后的目录保存早期版本的身份和 API 令牌。0.3 版不读取它们；在仍需要其中记录期间请保留该目录。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:81
msgid ""
"The installer leaves a data directory in place while a daemon of the "
"earlier release that cannot be stopped still uses it. In a terminal, "
"``sudo`` asks for the password once when an earlier release can be "
"removed only by the superuser; when it is declined, and without a "
"terminal, files that need the superuser are not changed. In these cases, "
"run the commands of the ``Note`` lines, or follow the steps of the next "
"section."
msgstr ""
"当无法停止的较早版本守护进程仍在使用数据目录时，安装脚本保留该目录不动。在终端中，当较早版本只能由超级用户删除时，``sudo`` "
"询问一次密码；密码提示被拒绝时以及没有终端时，安装脚本不修改需要超级用户权限的文件。遇到这些情况，请运行 ``Note`` "
"行中的命令，或按照下一节的步骤操作。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:87
msgid ""
"On Windows, run the installation command again (see :ref:`intro-install-"
"windows`); it updates an installation in place and reuses its directory "
"when that directory passes the checks. The installer takes over from an "
"earlier ANet without asking: an ANet of the 1.x npm package, 0.1 or 0.2 "
"on the ``PATH`` or in the global npm prefix is stopped with its own "
"``stop`` command, its npm package is removed with ``npm uninstall -g "
"@agentnetwork/anet``, and its data in ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` is renamed"
" to ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-legacy-<version>-<UTC time>``. When that "
"directory already holds an identity of 0.3 or later, only the entries of "
"the earlier release are moved. Nothing is deleted. An installation of 0.3"
" or later in another directory is taken off the user's ``PATH``."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，再次运行安装命令（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"windows`）；该命令就地更新安装，若原目录通过检查则继续使用该目录。安装程序不经询问即接管较早的 ANet：位于 ``PATH`` 或全局 "
"npm 前缀中的 1.x npm 包、0.1 或 0.2 版本的 ANet 以其自身的 ``stop`` 命令停止，其 npm 包通过 ``npm"
" uninstall -g @agentnetwork/anet`` 卸载，其位于 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` "
"的数据被重命名为 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-legacy-<版本>-<UTC 时间>``。若该目录中已有 0.3 "
"或更高版本的身份，则仅移出较早版本的条目。不删除任何内容。位于其他目录的 0.3 或更高版本的安装会从用户的 ``PATH`` 中移除。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:99
msgid "Upgrade a node by hand"
msgstr "手动升级节点"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:101
msgid ""
"These steps apply when the installer cannot complete the upgrade, and to "
"installations that the installer does not manage."
msgstr "安装脚本无法完成升级时，以及安装脚本不管理的安装，采用以下步骤。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:104
msgid "Stop the daemon of the earlier release."
msgstr "停止早期版本的守护进程。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:110
msgid ""
"AgentNetwork 1.x stops with ``anet stop``. Remove its npm package "
"afterwards:"
msgstr "AgentNetwork 1.x 用 ``anet stop`` 停止，随后删除其 npm 包："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:117
msgid ""
"Move the data directory aside. A 0.3 daemon refuses to start on it and "
"says ``identity_v02``; nothing in it is deleted by the refusal."
msgstr "将数据目录移至别处。0.3 守护进程拒绝在其上启动并提示 ``identity_v02``，该拒绝不会删除其中任何内容。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:124
msgid ""
"Install 0.3. The installer verifies the signed release manifest before it"
" installs (see :doc:`intro/install`). ``anet update`` from 0.2 also "
"replaces the binary after it verified the manifest."
msgstr ""
"安装 0.3。安装程序在安装前验证已签名的发布清单（参见 :doc:`intro/install`）。从 0.2 执行 ``anet "
"update`` 也会在验证清单后替换二进制文件。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:133
msgid "Start the node and write the safe defaults."
msgstr "启动节点并写入安全的默认值。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:140
msgid ""
"Join a hub. The command asks for a recovery passphrase on the terminal "
"and writes the recovery file. Keep a copy of the file in a second place."
msgstr "加入 Hub。该命令在终端上请求输入恢复口令并写入恢复文件。请将该文件另存一份于其他位置。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:147
msgid ""
"On a hub that admits by AID, the command prints an ``anet-hub admit`` "
"line. Send it to the operator of the hub; the node completes the "
"registration by itself after the admission."
msgstr ""
"在按 AID 准入的 Hub 上，该命令会输出一行 ``anet-hub admit``\\ 。请将其发送给 Hub "
"的运维者，准入之后节点会自行完成注册。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:150
msgid ""
"Wire the coding agents again. The local A2A token is replaced, and the "
"MCP tools changed."
msgstr "重新配置编程 Agent。本地 A2A 令牌已被替换，MCP 工具也有变化。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:156
msgid "Enter the peers again and check the result."
msgstr "重新录入对端并检查结果。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:163
msgid ""
"Remove the keys of the next section from ``config.json`` before step 4, "
"if the file was copied from 0.2. The daemon does not start while one of "
"them is present."
msgstr "如果 ``config.json`` 是从 0.2 复制而来，请在第 4 步之前移除下一节所列的键。其中任何一个存在时，守护进程都不会启动。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:168
msgid "Configuration and commands that changed"
msgstr "已变更的配置与命令"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:170
msgid ""
"The daemon refuses to start with a removed key (``config_key_removed``), "
"and a removed command or option is refused with ``cli_removed`` and the "
"replacement. The complete tables are in :ref:`reference-config-removed` "
"and in the section on removed commands of :doc:`reference/cli`. The most "
"common changes are these."
msgstr ""
"守护进程在遇到已移除的键时拒绝启动（``config_key_removed``）；已移除的命令或选项以 ``cli_removed`` "
"拒绝并给出替代方式。完整的对照表见 :ref:`reference-config-removed` 以及 :doc:`reference/cli`"
" 中关于已移除命令的一节。最常见的变更如下。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:179
msgid "In 0.2"
msgstr "0.2 中"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:180
msgid "In 0.3"
msgstr "0.3 中"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:181
msgid "``anet hub-register <url> --token ...``"
msgstr "``anet hub-register <url> --token ...``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:182
msgid "``anet hub-register <url>``; the operator admits the AID."
msgstr "``anet hub-register <url>``；由运维者准入该 AID。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:183
msgid "``anet profile set --pricing``, ``payments.publish_prices``"
msgstr "``anet profile set --pricing``\\ 、\\ ``payments.publish_prices``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:184
msgid "Prices are signed in the extended card; ``anet card <aid>`` shows them."
msgstr "价格在扩展卡片中签名，``anet card <aid>`` 可显示价格。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:185
msgid "``anet delegate ... --pay``, ``anet x402-authorize``"
msgstr "``anet delegate ... --pay``\\ 、\\ ``anet x402-authorize``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:186
msgid ""
"A quote within the limits is paid automatically; otherwise ``anet pay "
"<task>``."
msgstr "限额内的报价自动支付，否则使用 ``anet pay <task>``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:187
msgid "``accept_delegations``, ``anet accept``"
msgstr "``accept_delegations``\\ 、\\ ``anet accept``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:188
msgid "``anet inbound policy closed|approve|open``."
msgstr "``anet inbound policy closed|approve|open``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:189
msgid "``anet evidence``"
msgstr "``anet evidence``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:190
msgid "``anet audit --type``."
msgstr "``anet audit --type``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:191
msgid "``anet install``"
msgstr "``anet install``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:192
msgid "``anet agents wire <tool>``."
msgstr "``anet agents wire <tool>``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:193
msgid "``auto_reply.api_key``, ``anet autoreply set --api-key``"
msgstr "``auto_reply.api_key``\\ 、\\ ``anet autoreply set --api-key``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:194
msgid "``anet autoreply set --api-key-stdin``."
msgstr "``anet autoreply set --api-key-stdin``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:195
msgid "``providers.anetlink``"
msgstr "``providers.anetlink``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:196
msgid "``modules.anetlink``."
msgstr "``modules.anetlink``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:197
msgid "``rotation_grace``"
msgstr "``rotation_grace``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:198
msgid "Fixed at 1 hour."
msgstr "固定为 1 小时。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:199
msgid "``anet autoreply set --max-auto-replies``, ``--poll-interval``"
msgstr "``anet autoreply set --max-auto-replies``、``--poll-interval``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:200
msgid ""
"Fixed values; remove the options (refused with ``cli_removed`` from "
"0.3.1)."
msgstr "已改为固定值，请删掉这两个参数（自 0.3.1 起以 ``cli_removed`` 拒绝）。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:203
msgid "Behavior that differs"
msgstr "行为差异"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:205
msgid ""
"A new node accepts no task from a peer that is not on the allow list, and"
" spends nothing automatically. The defaults are written by ``anet init``."
msgstr "新节点不接受来自允许列表之外的对端的任何任务，也不自动支出。默认值由 ``anet init`` 写入。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:207
msgid "Tasks of untrusted peers are answered only in the sandbox, if at all."
msgstr "不受信任对端的任务只在沙箱中应答，或不予应答。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:208
msgid ""
"Task content is deleted 30 days after the task ends. ``anet retention`` "
"shows and changes it."
msgstr "任务内容在任务结束 30 天后删除，``anet retention`` 可显示并更改该期限。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:209
msgid ""
"A delegation that is not confirmed within ``no_response_after`` (15 "
"minutes) fails with ``delivery_unconfirmed``, and a refusal of the other "
"side arrives with its reason."
msgstr ""
"在 ``no_response_after``\\ （15 分钟）内未获确认的委派以 ``delivery_unconfirmed`` "
"失败，对方的拒绝连同原因送达。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:211
msgid ""
"The commands ``find``, ``delegate``, ``message`` and ``task`` print JSON "
"on standard output and readable lines on standard error. A script that "
"parsed the earlier combined output has to read standard output only."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``find``\\ 、\\ ``delegate``\\ 、\\ ``message`` 和 ``task`` 在标准输出输出 "
"JSON，在标准错误输出可读行。解析早期合并输出的脚本需改为只读取标准输出。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:214
msgid ""
"``auto_reply.api_base`` must use ``https://``, or ``http://`` on the "
"loopback interface; any other address is refused with "
"``api_base_insecure``. A model service that is reachable only over plain "
"HTTP on a private network needs a TLS endpoint, or a forwarder that "
"listens on the loopback interface of the node's host."
msgstr ""
"``auto_reply.api_base`` 必须使用 ``https://``，或环回接口上的 ``http://``；其他地址以 "
"``api_base_insecure`` 拒绝。只能经私有网络上明文 HTTP 访问的模型服务，需要提供 TLS "
"端点，或在节点所在主机的环回接口上设置转发。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:218
msgid "Nodes and hubs of 0.2 and 0.3 cannot talk to each other."
msgstr "0.2 与 0.3 的节点和 Hub 之间无法通信。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:222
msgid "Upgrade a hub"
msgstr "升级 Hub"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:224
msgid ""
"A hub is deployed again. A 0.3 hub does not open the data directory of a "
"0.2 hub (``hub_identity_v02``), and a 0.2 daemon does not talk to it."
msgstr ""
"Hub 需重新部署。0.3 Hub 不会打开 0.2 Hub 的数据目录（``hub_identity_v02``），0.2 "
"守护进程也无法与其通信。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:227
msgid "Install ANetHub 0.3 and start it with a new, empty data directory."
msgstr "安装 ANetHub 0.3，并以全新的空数据目录启动。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:233
msgid ""
"Set the recovery passphrase of the hub identity on a terminal, and store "
"the recovery file outside the data directory."
msgstr "在终端上设置 Hub 身份的恢复口令，并将恢复文件存放在数据目录之外。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:240
msgid ""
"Choose the registration mode. A new hub is ``closed``. Admit the AIDs of "
"the first nodes, or open registration with its three gates."
msgstr "选择注册模式。新 Hub 为 ``closed``\\ 。可准入首批节点的 AID，或开放注册并启用三道关口。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:248
msgid ""
"Replace the flags of 0.2 that became subcommands. ``-grant``, ``-due``, "
"``-clear`` and ``-invite-*`` stop the program with ``hub_flag_removed`` "
"and the subcommand to use."
msgstr ""
"替换 0.2 中已改为子命令的标志。\\ ``-grant``\\ 、\\ ``-due``\\ 、\\ ``-clear`` 和 "
"``-invite-*`` 会使程序停止，并以 ``hub_flag_removed`` 提示应使用的子命令。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:250
msgid ""
"Set ``client_max_body_size`` of the reverse proxy to at least the value "
"of ``--relay-max-envelope`` (96 MiB by default)."
msgstr ""
"将反向代理的 ``client_max_body_size`` 设为不小于 ``--relay-max-envelope`` 的值（默认为 96 "
"MiB）。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:252
msgid ""
"For federation, write ``federation.json`` with the 0.3 peers (see "
":doc:`ops/federation`). The routes ``/fed/v1`` and ``/fed/v2`` do not "
"exist."
msgstr ""
"如需联邦，请编写含 0.3 对等方的 ``federation.json``\\ （参见 :doc:`ops/federation`）。路由 "
"``/fed/v1`` 与 ``/fed/v2`` 已不存在。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:254
msgid ""
"Keep the old deployment in read-only form for as long as the operator "
"needs its records. It cannot be reopened by the 0.3 programs."
msgstr "在运维者需要旧记录期间，以只读形式保留旧部署。0.3 程序无法重新打开它。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:257
msgid "See :doc:`ops/deployment` and :doc:`ops/backup`."
msgstr "参见 :doc:`ops/deployment` 与 :doc:`ops/backup`\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:261
msgid "Clients that used the hub gateway"
msgstr "使用过 Hub 网关的客户端"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:263
msgid ""
"The route ``/x402/resource/...`` of 0.2 answers 410 ``gateway_removed``, "
"and voucher redemption is gone. A client that spoke plain HTTP x402 "
"installs ``anet`` and calls capabilities through the local A2A interface "
"of the node. The daemon signs the payment; the client sends ``payment-"
"submitted`` without ``x402.payment.payload``. See :doc:`howto/local-a2a` "
"and :doc:`topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"0.2 的路由 ``/x402/resource/...`` 以 410 ``gateway_removed`` 应答，凭证兑换也已取消。使用普通"
" HTTP x402 的客户端需安装 ``anet``，并通过节点的本地 A2A 接口调用能力。守护进程负责签署支付，客户端发送不含 "
"``x402.payment.payload`` 的 ``payment-submitted``\\ 。参见 :doc:`howto/local-"
"a2a` 与 :doc:`topics/payments`\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:269
msgid ""
"Scripts that read the 0.2 reason codes, the control-plane error bodies or"
" the structure of task metadata should be checked against :doc:`reference"
"/reason-codes`. The codes were merged: for example ``provider_busy``, "
"``quota_global_per_min`` and ``max_inflight`` are now ``busy``."
msgstr ""
"读取 0.2 原因码、控制面错误体或任务元数据结构的脚本，应对照 :doc:`reference/reason-codes` "
"检查。原因码已经合并，例如 ``provider_busy``\\ 、\\ ``quota_global_per_min`` 和 "
"``max_inflight`` 现在统一为 ``busy``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:275
msgid "After the upgrade"
msgstr "升级之后"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:277
msgid ""
"``anet doctor`` reports the state of the node. A line at level ``warn`` "
"or ``fail`` names its next step."
msgstr "``anet doctor`` 报告节点状态。级别为 ``warn`` 或 ``fail`` 的行会指出下一步。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:279
msgid ""
"``anet status`` states whether the recovery passphrase is set, and "
"whether the hub has confirmed the key."
msgstr "``anet status`` 说明恢复口令是否已设置，以及 Hub 是否已确认密钥。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:281
msgid ""
"The 0.2 data directory can be deleted when it is no longer needed. Before"
" that, copy files that are to be kept, for example exported evidence."
msgstr "0.2 数据目录在不再需要时可以删除。删除之前，请先复制需要保留的文件，例如已导出的证据。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:288
msgid "Upgrading to 0.3.6"
msgstr "升级到 0.3.6"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:290
msgid ""
"Version 0.3.6 is an in-place upgrade of 0.3.x. The data directory, the "
"identity and the configuration are kept, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"Update the node and restart its daemons:"
msgstr "0.3.6 是 0.3.x 的原地升级。数据目录、身份和配置均保留，Hub 无需升级。更新节点并重启其守护进程："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:299
msgid ""
"On Linux and macOS, the installation command is the single line ``curl "
"--proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -fsSL https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.sh |"
" sh``. The installer now starts the node and joins "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` itself, with ``anet hub-register "
"--passphrase-later``; the commands ``anet up`` and ``anet hub-register`` "
"that followed the installation are no longer needed, and the recovery "
"passphrase is set afterwards with ``anet identity protect``. Running the "
"command again on a node that has already joined a hub keeps that hub and "
"restarts a running node with the new binary. A script or an agent that "
"must not join a hub passes ``--no-join``, or ``--no-start`` to leave the "
"node stopped (see :ref:`intro-install-options`)."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 和 macOS 上，安装命令为单独一行 ``curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -fsSL "
"https://agentnetwork.org.cn/install.sh | sh``。安装脚本现在以 ``anet hub-register"
" --passphrase-later`` 自行启动节点并加入 "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``；安装之后不再需要运行 ``anet up`` 和 ``anet hub-"
"register``，恢复口令之后以 ``anet identity protect`` 设置。在已加入 Hub 的节点上再次运行该命令时，保留该"
" Hub，并以新的二进制文件重启正在运行的节点。不应加入 Hub 的脚本或 Agent 传入 ``--no-join``，或以 ``--no-"
"start`` 使节点保持停止（参见 :ref:`intro-install-options`）。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:309
msgid ""
"The installer prints a few lines and a summary, and writes the details to"
" ``~/.anet/logs/install-<UTC time>.log`` (see :ref:`intro-install-"
"output`). The section ``Upgraded from anet <version>`` is in that log, no"
" longer in the output. A script that searched the output for it reads the"
" log, or the line ``Replaced <release>`` of the summary."
msgstr ""
"安装脚本输出几行文字和一段摘要，并将详细信息写入 ``~/.anet/logs/install-<UTC 时间>.log``\\ （参见 :ref"
":`intro-install-output`）。``Upgraded from anet <version>`` "
"一节位于该日志中，不再出现在输出中。在输出中查找该节的脚本应改为读取日志，或读取摘要中的 ``Replaced <release>`` 一行。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:314
msgid ""
"In a terminal, the installer may ask for the password of ``sudo`` once, "
"to remove an earlier release that only the superuser can remove, or to "
"create the command link ``/usr/local/bin/anet`` (see :ref:`intro-install-"
"sudo`). Without a terminal, nothing is asked, as before."
msgstr ""
"在终端中，安装脚本可能询问一次 ``sudo`` 密码，用于删除只有超级用户才能删除的较早版本，或创建命令链接 "
"``/usr/local/bin/anet``\\ （参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"sudo`）。没有终端时，与以往相同，不进行任何询问。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:319
msgid ""
"The download sources change for ``install.sh`` and ``anet update`` alike "
"(see :ref:`intro-install-hosts`). npmmirror, as the tarball of the npm "
"package, and GitHub Releases are asked first, followed by the npm "
"registry, jsDelivr and the project hosts. The files of npm packages are "
"no longer requested from unpkg or by path from npmmirror. The variable "
"``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` now replaces every source of ``anet update``, as "
"``--base`` does, instead of being tried before the default sources. The "
"checks are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``install.sh`` 和 ``anet update`` 的下载源同样发生变化（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"hosts`）。最先询问 npmmirror（以 npm 包的 tarball 形式）和 GitHub Releases，其后为 npm "
"注册表、jsDelivr 和项目主机。npm 包中的文件不再从 unpkg 获取，也不再按路径从 npmmirror 获取。变量 "
"``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 现在与 ``--base`` 一样取代 ``anet update`` "
"的全部下载源，而不再在默认下载源之前尝试。检查保持不变。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:326
msgid ""
"On Windows, running the installation command again updates the node and "
"restarts a node of an earlier version with the new binary. Without "
"``-Controller``, the command now also starts the node and registers it "
"with ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``; a script that relied on the "
"0.3.5 behaviour, in which the plain command only installed, passes "
"``-NoStart`` (neither start nor join) or ``-NoJoin`` (start without "
"joining). The installer prints a short summary and writes the details to "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet\\logs\\install-<UTC time>.log``; a script that "
"parsed the earlier output reads the summary lines or the log instead (see"
" :ref:`intro-install-windows-output`). The download sources changed (see "
":ref:`intro-install-windows-sources`); a mirror or a CI job that sets "
"``-Base`` or ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` is not affected."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，再次运行安装命令会更新节点，并以新的二进制文件重新启动运行较早版本的节点。不带 ``-Controller`` "
"时，该命令现在同样启动节点并将其注册到 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``；依赖 0.3.5 "
"行为（普通命令仅安装）的脚本，请指定 ``-NoStart``\\ （既不启动也不加入）或 ``-NoJoin``\\ "
"（启动但不加入）。安装程序输出简短的摘要，并将详细信息写入 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet\\logs\\install-<UTC "
"time>.log``；解析早期输出的脚本请改为读取摘要行或日志（参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"output`）。下载源已更改（参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-sources`）；指定 ``-Base`` 或 "
"``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 的镜像或 CI 作业不受影响。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:341
msgid "Upgrading to 0.3.5"
msgstr "升级到 0.3.5"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:343
msgid ""
"Version 0.3.5 is an in-place upgrade of 0.3.x. The data directory, the "
"identity and the configuration are kept, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"Update the node and restart its daemons:"
msgstr "0.3.5 是 0.3.x 的原地升级。数据目录、身份和配置均保留，Hub 无需升级。更新节点并重启其守护进程："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:352
msgid ""
"Running the installation command again also updates a node: "
"``install.sh`` on Linux and macOS, and the command of :ref:`intro-"
"install-windows` on Windows. From 0.3.5, both installers take over from "
"AgentNetwork 1.x, anet 0.1 and anet 0.2 in the same run (see :ref"
":`upgrading-installer`) and ask nothing."
msgstr ""
"再次运行安装命令同样会更新节点：Linux 与 macOS 上为 ``install.sh``，Windows 上为 :ref:`intro-"
"install-windows` 中的命令。自 0.3.5 起，两种安装程序都会在同一次运行中接管 AgentNetwork 1.x、anet "
"0.1 与 anet 0.2（参见 :ref:`upgrading-installer`），且不进行任何询问。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:357
msgid ""
"On Windows, the installer no longer asks a confirmation for "
"``-Controller``: the parameter on the command line is the consent. A "
"script that relied on that confirmation as a second step now grants "
"access as soon as the command runs. ``install.sh --system`` no longer "
"prompts for a password; run ``sudo -v`` first."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，安装程序不再为 ``-Controller`` "
"请求确认：命令行中的该参数即为同意。依赖该确认作为第二步的脚本，现在会在命令运行时即授予访问权限。``install.sh --system`` "
"不再询问密码，请先运行 ``sudo -v``。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:366
msgid "Upgrading to 0.3.4"
msgstr "升级到 0.3.4"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:368
msgid ""
"Version 0.3.4 is an in-place upgrade of 0.3.x. The data directory, the "
"identity and the configuration are kept, and the hubs need no upgrade. "
"Update the node and restart its daemons:"
msgstr "0.3.4 是 0.3.x 的原地升级。数据目录、身份和配置均保留，Hub 无需升级。更新节点并重启其守护进程："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:377
msgid ""
"One check changes on Linux and macOS. ``anet doctor`` reports the "
"recovery file under ``identity.recovery`` only when another account can "
"read it. A recovery file with mode ``0400`` was reported before 0.3.4 and"
" is now reported as in place. The sentence of ``identity.recovery_perm`` "
"names the command of the platform that makes the file private; the code "
"is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 与 macOS 上有一项检查发生变化。``anet doctor`` 仅在恢复文件可被其他账户读取时才在 "
"``identity.recovery`` 下报告该文件。权限为 ``0400`` 的恢复文件在 0.3.4 "
"之前会被报告，现在报告为就位。``identity.recovery_perm`` 的语句给出本平台使该文件变为私有的命令；代码不变。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:383
msgid ""
"From 0.3.4, ``anet update`` also tries the npm packages of the build "
"after the project hosts (see :ref:`intro-install-hosts`). The checks are "
"the same for every host. An installation from npm is updated with npm "
"instead (see :ref:`intro-install-npm`)."
msgstr ""
"自 0.3.4 起，``anet update`` 在项目主机之后还会尝试该构建的 npm 包（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"hosts`）。对每台主机的校验相同。通过 npm 安装的节点改用 npm 更新（参见 :ref:`intro-install-npm`）。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:387
msgid ""
"Windows is supported natively from 0.3.4. On Windows, ``anet`` is "
"installed with the PowerShell script ``install.ps1``, as described in "
":ref:`intro-install-windows`. A node that runs inside WSL2 is a Linux "
"node with its own data directory and identity; the Windows build does not"
" read that directory."
msgstr ""
"自 0.3.4 起原生支持 Windows。在 Windows 上，``anet`` 通过 PowerShell 脚本 "
"``install.ps1`` 安装，详见 :ref:`intro-install-windows`。在 WSL2 中运行的节点是 Linux "
"节点，拥有自己的数据目录和身份；Windows 版本不读取该目录。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:396
msgid "Upgrading to 0.3.3"
msgstr "升级到 0.3.3"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:398
msgid "Version 0.3.3 is an in-place upgrade of 0.3.x. One behavior changes."
msgstr "0.3.3 是 0.3.x 的原地升级。有一项行为发生变化。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:400
msgid ""
"Output is English on every system, including a system with a Chinese "
"locale. Before 0.3.3, anet and anet-hub chose Chinese when ``LC_ALL``, "
"``LC_MESSAGES`` or ``LANG`` began with ``zh``. Since 0.3.3 only the "
"variable ``ANET_LANG`` selects Chinese, and the locale variables are not "
"consulted. To keep Chinese sentences, set the variable in the environment"
" of the daemon, of the command line and of the hub:"
msgstr ""
"在所有系统上，包括使用中文区域设置的系统，输出均为英文。0.3.3 之前，当 ``LC_ALL``、``LC_MESSAGES`` 或 "
"``LANG`` 以 ``zh`` 开头时，anet 和 anet-hub 选择中文。自 0.3.3 起，只有变量 ``ANET_LANG`` "
"选择中文，区域设置变量不再参与判断。要保留中文语句，请在守护进程、命令行和 hub 的环境中设置该变量："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:410
msgid ""
"Any value that begins with ``zh`` in any letter case selects Chinese; any"
" other value, or no value, selects English. Scripts that match the "
"Chinese text of a sentence need the variable set, or need to match the "
"English text. The sentences that anet hands to a model, such as the "
"egress refusals read by a sandboxed agent, are English in both languages."
" See :doc:`reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"以 ``zh`` 开头的值（不区分大小写）选择中文；其他值或未设置时选择英文。匹配语句中文文本的脚本需要设置该变量，或改为匹配英文文本。anet "
"交给模型的语句，例如沙箱中的 agent 所读取的出站拒绝语句，在两种语言下均为英文。参见 :doc:`reference/reason-"
"codes`\\ 。"

#~ msgid "Stop the 0.2 daemon."
#~ msgstr "停止 0.2 守护进程。"

